      * ck_kw64 (sp1 - 56) (bv_unsigned (getr R0 21%bv)) F7.
      * e_unk. * e_wr. * e_range.
      * ck_kw64 (SB + 64) w0 C64. * ck_kw64 (SB + 72) w1 C72. * ck_kw64 (SB + 80) w2 C80. * ck_kw32 (SB + 96) 8 C96.
      * e_unk. * e_wr. * e_unk. * e_wr. * e_disj.
